{"Title":"An Act reducing CPA recording fees for affordable housing","BillNumber":"H2791","DocketNumber":"HD1613","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AMF1","Name":"Ann-Margaret Ferrante","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMF1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:13:58.027"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AMF1","Name":"Ann-Margaret Ferrante","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMF1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:13:58.0266667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2791/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Ferrante of Gloucester, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2791) of Ann-Margaret Ferrante relative to recording fees paid by certified public accountants to registers of deeds and assistant recorders under the community preservation law.  Revenue.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 8a of chapter 44B of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by inserting the following after the words “Chapter 188” in line xx: or to the filing of any subordinate mortgage extended by any public agency or quasi-public agency, including but not limited to a Commonwealth municipality or the Massachusetts Housing Partnership.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 8b of chapter 44B of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by inserting the following after the words “Chapter 188” in line xx: or to the filing of any subordinate mortgage extended by any public agency or quasi-public agency, including but not limited to a Commonwealth municipality or the Massachusetts Housing Partnership.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J26","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J26"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}